  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">• Brand introduction:&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: black;\">Perfect Make-up made easy: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(25, 16, 8);\">Star make-up artist LONI BAUR is now there for everyone with all her experience. Every product come with a tutorial with her best tips. </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(25, 16, 8);\">For 25 years, Loni has been creating looks, trends and dreams for models and celebrities around the world. Clients like Lenny Kravitz, Charlene of Monaco and Heidi Klum have trusted her style expertise. From VOUGE to CHANEL - the beauty industry relies on her skills. She has been a fixture at fashion shows in Paris and New York for decades. Loni advises cosmetics companies on product development.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(25, 16, 8);\">Now it is time to give back. Loni's wish is for everyone to feel like they have been made up by a make-up artist. That's why she has developed THE FACE EDITION with her most beautiful looks, as well as luxurious individual products that meet the highest demands. Always with a tutorial with Loni's best tips, made in Germany, nourishing, vegan and in accordance with Clean Beauty Standards.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">• Product description: Make-up by Germanys most successul Make-up-Artist Loni Baur&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Vegan, Made in Germany, Clean Beauty, Always with a How to Tutorial via QR Code.&nbsp;</span><br><br></p></div>",
